iff_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/7832.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/7832.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-05T05:20:07Z"},"body":"As part of the [dualstack changes described in A61](https://github.com/grpc/proposal/blob/master/A61-IPv4-IPv6-dualstack-backends.md#use-pick_first-as-the-universal-leaf-policy), `pickfirst` will become the universal leaf policy. This PR provides a `EnableHealthListener` function for petiole policies to inform pickfirst when it's functioning as a leaf policy.\r\n\r\nWhen functioning as a leaf policy, `pickfirst` will subscribe to health updates using the SubConn.RegisterHealthListener API introduced in https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/7780  once the SubConn connectivity state becomes READY. The health state will be used to update the `ClientConn` state as long as the SubConn's connectivity state remains READY.\r\n\r\nRELEASE NOTES: N/A","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7832/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7832/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7764","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7764/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7764/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7764/events","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/7764","id":2602624675,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAacf885_UyWo","number":7764,"title":"balancer/roundrobin: fix Pick() when subConnsLen is 0","user":{"login":"aranjans","id":159750762,"node_id":"U_kgDOCYWaag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159750762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aranjans","html_url":"https